<title>PHILIPPINES: Cosmos 9-mth net up at 186.48 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Cosmos 9-mth net up at 186.48 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30</p>
<p>		(in million pesos)</p>
<p>    Net income		    186.48 vs 112.59</p>
<p>Note: Full name Cosmos Bottling Corp. Chief executive officer Jose Concepcion III said the income level was the highest in the company's more than 75-year history.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
